5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am worried about the time it takes to manage the money.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to know the actual costs before setting any fees.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,The current system feels fragile. We need stability for everyone.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,People are hesitating to come out. The atmosphere is changing.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Some people do all the work. Others barely show up.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, do you have the numbers for last year?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
