35,2,1,talk,Minato,,The treasurer spent six hours a month chasing money. That is too much.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The ledger shows seventy percent of costs are fixed. Hall and insurance.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,Nine people left because they did not want a whole year commitment.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,Turnout dropped by a third after the summer door charge. It never recovered.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,A quarter of members do two-thirds of the work. Eighteen never show up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, if costs are fixed, why do we charge per event?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,Because a third of renewals needed reminders. People struggle with big sums.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,The old named grades caused friction. People stopped applying.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,The quieter members feel uneasy about the cost per visit.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,The same nine people set up and lock up. It is unfair.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,I think a flat fee is too hard for some.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,But activity-based charging is a nightmare for the treasurer.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,"Tiered membership might work, but it feels exclusionary.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,We need something simple. No weighing up every time.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If we do not fix the imbalance, the core members will leave.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
